---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Refund and cancellation policy" description="Cancellation and refund terms for Kamer hostel management app subscriptions.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Legal</span><h1>Refund and cancellation policy</h1></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section tight">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>Effective Date: 1st January 2025</p>
      <p>This Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy applies to subscription purchases made by hostel and PG owners (&quot;you&quot;) for the Kamer hostel management application, operated by L4Links Solutions Private Limited (&quot;Kamer&quot;, &quot;we&quot;, &quot;our&quot;, or &quot;us&quot;).</p>
      <h2>1. Subscription Plans</h2>
      <p>Kamer is offered on a subscription basis to hostel and PG owners. Subscription fees, billing cycles, and any applicable trial periods are shown to you at the time of purchase within the app.</p>
      <h2>2. Cancellation</h2>
      <p>You may cancel your subscription at any time from within the app or by contacting us at [email protected]. Cancelling stops future renewals; it does not automatically entitle you to a refund for the current billing period, except as described below.</p>
      <h2>3. Refunds</h2>
      <p>Because Kamer is a software service that is provisioned immediately on payment, subscription fees are generally non-refundable once a billing period has started. We may, at our discretion, consider a refund in cases such as:</p>
      <ul>
      <li>A duplicate or accidental charge for the same subscription period</li>
      <li>A verified technical failure that prevented you from using the service for a significant part of the billing period</li>
      <li>An unauthorised transaction, subject to our review and applicable payment gateway rules</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To request a refund, contact us at [email protected] with your registered mobile number/email and the payment reference. We will review the request and respond with a decision.</p>
      <h2>4. Approved Refunds</h2>
      <p>If a refund is approved, it will be processed to the original payment method through our payment gateway, Razorpay. Depending on your bank or card issuer, it may take a few business days for the refunded amount to reflect in your account after we initiate it.</p>
      <h2>5. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with a revised effective date. Your continued use of Kamer after a change constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.</p>
      <h2>6. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>For any questions about this policy or to raise a refund request, please contact us at:</p>
      <p>Kamer App</p>
      <p>Email: [email protected]</p>
      <p>Website: kamerapp.com</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .prose a { color: var(--orange-dark); font-weight: 700; }
</style>
